### Trained-model cache (derived from training; can be regenerated) ###
# Leading slash anchors this to the repo root — without it the rule matches
# any directory named `data` in the tree, including `src/main/java/.../data/`
# (the data-access source package), which then needs `git add -f` to commit.
/data/
.claude/
